  "notes": "STATIC clusters carry an inline ClusterLoadAssignment whose cluster_name must match the cluster. The assignment is decoded through the existing bounded EDS parser and projected through the same priority/locality runtime. STATIC clusters request no EDS subscription; switching a selected cluster between EDS and STATIC updates the subscription set in the same transaction. Native tests cover decode acceptance/rejection, SotW publication, delta publication, endpoint reprojection and absent EDS subscriptions."
